"events`` agent skill (:isaaclab-source:`skills/user/domain-randomization-"
"events/ <skills/user/domain-randomization-events/SKILL.md>`). When you "
"change this page, update the skill so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
